          "settings": {
            "code": "<div id=\"notification\" class=\"notification\">\n    <span id=\"notification-text\" class=\"notification-text\">\n      <p class=\"custom_heading\">Dear customer, please note these points when shopping from Jazmin.</p><br>\n\n      <hr><br>\n\n      1- <a href=\"https://www.jazmin.pk\" target=\"_blank\">www.jazmin.pk</a> and <a href=\"https://www.jazminpk.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.jazminpk.com</a> are the only official stores for Jazmin. We will not be responsible if you shop from anywhere else assuming it's <a href=\"https://www.jazmin.pk\" target=\"_blank\">www.jazmin.pk</a> or <a href=\"https://www.jazminpk.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.jazminpk.com</a>.<br><br>\n\n      2- For COD orders, never hand over the cash to the rider unless the rider is at your doorstep. Do not pay anything to any rider or any unofficial bank account when you are shopping from our official website.<br><br>\n\n      3 - For paid orders, do not pay any amount to the riders. For COD orders, pay only the order amount and no courier charges, as Jazmin offers free shipping in Pakistan.<br><br>\n\n      4- Orders from <a href=\"https://www.jazmin.pk\" target=\"_blank\">www.jazmin.pk</a> and <a href=\"https://www.jazminpk.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.jazminpk.com</a> are always delivered in our official flyers with the logo on top of them. Do not accept the order if you receive it in any other parcel packaging.\n\n<img class=\"custom_image_wrap\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0011/0277/4316/files/IMG_0117_992ac66e-1bd4-4629-afec-490acebf1984.jpg?v=1740571838\">\n\n    </span>\n    <button id=\"read-more-btn\" class=\"read-more-btn\">Read More</button>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .notification {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #000000;\n    padding: 25px;\n    position: relative;\n    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;\n    transition: max-height 0.5s ease-out, opacity 0.5s ease-out;\n    max-height: 100px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .expanded {\n    max-height: 1500px !important;\n    overflow: visible;\n    transition: max-height 0.5s ease-out;\n  }\n\n  p.custom_heading {\n    font-family: var(--heading-font-family);\n    font-weight: var(--heading-font-weight);\n    font-style: var(--heading-font-style);\n    letter-spacing: var(--heading-letter-spacing);\n    text-transform: var(--heading-text-transform);\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n  .notification-text {\n    font-weight: 300;\n  }\n\n/* General Button Styling */\n#read-more-btn {\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 10px;\n  right: 10px;\n  padding: 3px 12px;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #fff;\n  background-color: #1a1a1a;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: background-color 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;\n  z-index: 3;\n}\n\n/* Hover and Focus Effects */\n#read-more-btn:hover {\n  background-color: #fff;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 40%);\n  outline: none;\n  color: black;\n}\n\n/* Text Slide Animation */\n#read-more-btn::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: white;\n  transition: transform 0.5s ease;\n  z-index: -1; /* Move the background behind the button text */\n  transform: translateX(-100%);\n}\n\n#read-more-btn:hover::before {\n  transform: translateX(0);\n}\n\n/* Ensure the text stays visible */\n#read-more-btn span {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1; /* Ensure text remains on top */\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Button Glow and Shadow */\n#read-more-btn:active {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n  transform: scale(0.98);\n}\n\n/* Smooth border hover expansion */\n#read-more-btn::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 0;\n  border: 2px solid #000000;\n  transition: width 0.4s ease, height 0.4s ease, top 0.4s ease, left 0.4s ease;\n  z-index: -1; /* Keep the expanding border behind the button text */\n}\n\n#read-more-btn:hover::after {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n}\n\n\n\n\n  @keyframes fadeIn {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(-15px);\n    }\n    100% {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .notification {\n      max-height: 115px;\n    }\n  }\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {\n    .notification {\n      max-height: 120px;\n    }\n  }\n\n.notification hr {\n    display: none;\n}\n\n.expanded hr {\n    display: block;\n}\n\nimg.custom_image_wrap {\n    border-bottom-left-radius: 30px;\n    border-bottom-right-radius: 30px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    width: 100% !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  document.getElementById('read-more-btn').addEventListener('click', function() {\n    var notification = document.getElementById('notification');\n    var button = document.getElementById('read-more-btn');\n    \n    if (notification.classList.contains('expanded')) {\n      notification.classList.remove('expanded');\n      button.textContent = 'Read More';\n    } else {\n      notification.classList.add('expanded');\n      button.textContent = 'Show Less';\n    }\n  });\n</script>"
